 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "选了链下预言机，读取时还要做四项检查。",
   "spoken": "选了链下预言机，读取时还要做四项检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "一，价格大于 0。",
   "spoken": "一，价格大于 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.212,
   "dur": 2.856,
   "speechStart": 6.31,
   "speechEnd": 8.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "二，时效：现在的时间减去更新时间，不超过这个喂价的心跳。",
   "spoken": "二，时效：现在的时间减去更新时间，不超过这个喂价的心跳。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.288,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 9.386,
   "speechEnd": 14.624
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "三，上下限：价格落在合理的区间里。",
   "spoken": "三，上下限：价格落在合理的区间里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.676,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 15.774,
   "speechEnd": 19.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "四，精度：从喂价读取小数位数，不要写死 8。",
   "spoken": "四，精度：从喂价读取小数位数，不要写死 8。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.288,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 20.386,
   "speechEnd": 24.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "为什么要查上下限？看一个案例。",
   "spoken": "为什么要查上下限？看一个案例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.548,
   "dur": 3.504,
   "speechStart": 25.646,
   "speechEnd": 28.215
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "2022 年 5 月，LUNA 崩盘。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 5 月，LUNA 崩盘。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.272,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 29.37,
   "speechEnd": 31.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "公开报道称，Chainlink 的 LUNA 喂价，设了一个最低价：0.10 美元。",
   "spoken": "公开报道称，Chainlink 的 LUNA 喂价，设了一个最低价：0.10 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 32.636,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 32.734,
   "speechEnd": 38.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "市场价跌到远低于 0.10 美元，喂价停在下限附近。",
   "spoken": "市场价跌到远低于 0.10 美元，喂价停在下限附近。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.096,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 39.194,
   "speechEnd": 43.896
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "假设市场价是 0.01 美元。这是示例。",
   "spoken": "假设市场价是 0.01 美元。这是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.956,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 45.054,
   "speechEnd": 48.575
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "喂价仍然返回约 0.10 美元。抵押品被高估约 10 倍。",
   "spoken": "喂价仍然返回约 0.10 美元。抵押品被高估约 10 倍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.64,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 49.738,
   "speechEnd": 54.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "价格是正的，时间戳也可能是新的。前两项检查，全部通过。",
   "spoken": "价格是正的，时间戳也可能是新的。前两项检查，全部通过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 55.572,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 55.67,
   "speechEnd": 61.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "BNB Chain 上的 Venus，仍按约 0.1 美元给 LUNA 抵押品估值。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain 上的 Venus，仍按约 0.1 美元给 LUNA 抵押品估值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 62.104,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 62.202,
   "speechEnd": 66.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "有人在市场上低价买入 LUNA，存进去，借出别的资产。",
   "spoken": "有人在市场上低价买入 LUNA，存进去，借出别的资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 67.94,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 68.038,
   "speechEnd": 72.538
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "按公开报道，协议损失约 1100 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按公开报道，协议损失约 1100 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 73.608,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 73.706,
   "speechEnd": 77.158
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "还有四个读取陷阱。",
   "spoken": "还有四个读取陷阱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.22,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 78.318,
   "speechEnd": 79.651
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "第一，不要用 latestAnswer 判断价格新不新鲜。",
   "spoken": "第一，不要用 latestAnswer 判断价格新不新鲜。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 80.72,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 80.818,
   "speechEnd": 84.401
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "Chainlink 的 API 文档写明，它不含时间戳。改用 latestRoundData。",
   "spoken": "Chainlink 的 API 文档写明，它不含时间戳。改用 latestRoundData。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 85.452,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 85.55,
   "speechEnd": 90.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "第二，每个喂价的心跳不同。不要给所有资产，用同一个延迟上限。",
   "spoken": "第二，每个喂价的心跳不同。不要给所有资产，用同一个延迟上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 92.032,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 92.13,
   "speechEnd": 97.806
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "第三，喂价失效时，要有降级路径。",
   "spoken": "第三，喂价失效时，要有降级路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 98.876,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 98.974,
   "speechEnd": 102.378
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "用 try catch 包住读取，切到备用价格源，或者暂停。不要让清算全部回滚。",
   "spoken": "用 try catch 包住读取，切到备用价格源，或者暂停。不要让清算全部回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 103.44,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 103.538,
   "speechEnd": 109.678
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "第四，拉取式预言机，由用户在交易里提交签名价格。",
   "spoken": "第四，拉取式预言机，由用户在交易里提交签名价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-21.mp3",
   "start": 110.74,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 110.838,
   "speechEnd": 115.528
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "提交者可以挑一个对自己有利的更新。",
   "spoken": "提交者可以挑一个对自己有利的更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-22.mp3",
   "start": 116.6,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 116.698,
   "speechEnd": 119.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "按 Pyth 文档，合约要自己检查价格的时间戳和置信区间。",
   "spoken": "按 Pyth 文档，合约要自己检查价格的时间戳和置信区间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-23.mp3",
   "start": 120.252,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 120.35,
   "speechEnd": 125.052
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-24",
   "text": "在 L2 上，要多查一项：排序器是否在线。",
   "spoken": "在 L2 上，要多查一项：排序器是否在线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-24.mp3",
   "start": 126.112,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 126.21,
   "speechEnd": 129.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-25",
   "text": "排序器宕机时，喂价交易上不了链，价格停在宕机前。",
   "spoken": "排序器宕机时，喂价交易上不了链，价格停在宕机前。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-25.mp3",
   "start": 130.916,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 131.014,
   "speechEnd": 135.406
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-26",
   "text": "恢复后的第一批区块里，清算机器人和普通用户同时涌入。",
   "spoken": "恢复后的第一批区块里，清算机器人和普通用户同时涌入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-26.mp3",
   "start": 136.464,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 136.562,
   "speechEnd": 141.097
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-27",
   "text": "能通过 L1 强制提交交易的少数人，占了先机。",
   "spoken": "能通过 L1 强制提交交易的少数人，占了先机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-27.mp3",
   "start": 142.156,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 142.254,
   "speechEnd": 146.027
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-28",
   "text": "按 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年 11 月的页面，Mantle 排序器宕机时，从 L1 强制提交，最长要等 12 小时。",
   "spoken": "按 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年 11 月的页面，Mantle 排序器宕机时，从 L1 强制提交，最常要等 12 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-28.mp3",
   "start": 147.08,
   "dur": 9.024,
   "speechStart": 147.178,
   "speechEnd": 155.261
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-29",
   "text": "做法是读取 Chainlink 提供的排序器在线状态喂价。",
   "spoken": "做法是读取 Chainlink 提供的排序器在线状态喂价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-29.mp3",
   "start": 156.324,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 156.422,
   "speechEnd": 160.838
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-30",
   "text": "恢复后设一段宽限期，比如 1 小时，这是示例。",
   "spoken": "恢复后设一段宽限期，比如 1 小时，这是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg5-30.mp3",
   "start": 161.896,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 161.994,
   "speechEnd": 165.541
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-31",
   "text": "宽限期内，暂停清算和新借款。",
   "spoken": "宽限期内，暂停清算和新借款。",
